The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:31.040
Dug myself into a hole with no way out

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:35.540
Back against the wall...

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.370
I mean, how could I resist?

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:39.080
"This wasn't supposed to happen,"

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.670
I keep denying

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:42.130
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:43.300
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:43.800
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:46.760
I can't stand myself

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:50.180
Moping around, spouting lies, grieving a broken heart

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:53.140
I hold on desperately to these feelings and shut my eyes

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:56.600
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:56.600
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:00.230
I suffocate under its weight

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:04.150
The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:07.570
