00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:51.450
<i>Focus!</i>

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:57.750
Episode       Peter Grill and the Orc's True Character

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.570
W-Wait a minute!

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:55.390
Don't do anything rash...

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:58.290
Besides, weren't you against this whole marriage proposal thing!?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:02:59.750
