00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.130
You are mistaken, Sir Peter!

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:05.000
If it means being with a noble man like you...

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.010
<i>Not again!</i>

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:11.470
<i>Don't let her pull you in...!</i>

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.440
Listen to me, Piglette!

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.330
The truth is...

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.640
I'm already engaged to another woman!

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.520
So, y'see... it wouldn't be right for us to...

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:22.730
Th-That's fine with me...

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:25.020
Sir Peter!

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:30.140
Orc relationships are different from Human relationships.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:32.910
Polygyny is the norm!

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.010
Not good...!

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:37.100
Take it easy, Piglette!

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.910
This entire thing is a setup!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.840
A conspiracy between Orcland and the Guild...

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.670
They're trying to lure us into a trap!

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:53.680
I-I'm glad you understand...

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:56.920
I knew it...

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.180
I'm not good enough, am I?

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.960
I'm far too ugly...

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:02.940
That's why...!

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:07.090
N-No!

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:08.360
That's not true!

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.720
You're the furthest thing from ugly!

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:13.070
In my opinion, from a Human perspective...

00:04:13.070 --> 00:04:16.080
You're beautiful exactly the way you are!

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.890
Sir Peter...

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:30.340
<i>This is bad...</i>

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:34.600
<i>Giving in is exactly what the Guildmaster wants...</i>

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:39.100
<i>At this point, I can't afford to do any more damage!</i>

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:42.980
<i>Then again, I...</i>

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.410
<i>Absolutely not!</i>

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:50.890
<i>I won't be swayed by an Orc!</i>

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:52.320
<i>Good.</i>

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.010
<i>Just take a deep breath!</i>

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:57.370
<i>Tap into the Eastern art of Zen
and clear your mind...</i>

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.580
<i>Remain calm...</i>

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:03.690
<i>Remain calm...</i>

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.270
<i>R-R-R-R-R-Remain calm...</i>

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:09.790
<i>R-R-R-R-R-R-R-R-R-R-R-Ra-da-da-da-da-da-da-da</i>

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:13.630
<i>Boobs!</i>

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:23.490
<i>Why...</i>

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:25.760
<i>Why!?</i>

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.560
<i>Why am I like this!?</i>

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.860
<i>Defeated by a pair of boobs...!</i>

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.420
<i>Oh crap...</i>

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.250
<i>I'm screwed...</i>

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.070
<i>Everything up 'til now doesn't even come close...</i>

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:41.370
<i>If Piglette reports back with the
truth about what happened...</i>

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:45.250
How dare you betray the trust of my darling Luvellia...!?

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.500
<i>He's gonna kill me for sure!</i>

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:53.030
<i>Anyone with eyes could see that it was a trap...</i>

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.880
<i>What's </i>wrong<i> with me!?</i>

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:58.440
<i>What's done is done.
There's only one choice left.</i>

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.550
<i>Convince Piglette to keep quiet!</i>

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:08.400
Good morning, Sir Peter.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:12.650
Last night was wonderful, don't you think?

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:16.580
And now I can deliver the good news to Master Babe.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:19.490
Sir Peter and I have successfully
consummated our relationship.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:22.960
H-Hold on!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:24.950
You can't tell anyone about this!

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:26.010
What!?

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.810
B-But...

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:29.920
Why not, Sir Peter!?

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.750
Y-Y'see...

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:35.750
<i>Think fast, Peter Grill!</i>

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:38.950
<i>By all accounts, there's no way outta this, </i>but<i>...</i>

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.220
<i>"When you give up, that's when the game is over!"</i>

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.560
S-Sir Peter...?

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.200
Are you...

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.810
Are you content with living the rest of
your life like a puppet on a string!?

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:57.530
The motive behind this marriage proposal
was political from the beginning.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:02.650
One of the most important decisions of your
life is being controlled by the national interest!

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.900
Are you truly satisfied with that!?

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.500
W-Well, I...

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:09.100
What do you really want!?

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.340
Deep inside your heart, what is it you desire!?

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:16.880
Don't you think you oughtta stop and take
the time to consider your options!?

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:23.640
<i>Well, you can't say I didn't try...
Question is, did she buy it...?</i>

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.070
What I really want...

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:30.760
What I desire, deep inside my heart...

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:34.780
L-Let me think it over...

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:40.970
Let's hear it, you two!

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:43.070
How did things go last night?

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:49.250
Our hope, of course, is that you were able to establish
the foundation for a positive relationship.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.440
Lady Piglette...

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:55.590
Were there any interesting developments
after dinner last night?

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:09.350
<i>H-Help me out... Please!</i>

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:12.810
<i>A miracle... Gimme a miracle, just this once!</i>

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:14.560
L-Last night...

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:19.590
Sir Peter stood firm.{firm indeed}

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:22.660
He didn't lay a single finger on me!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.990
C-Come again!?

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:30.410
<i>Are you telling me this bastard managed
to resist the Orc's ample assets!?</i>

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.670
<i>It's a miracle...</i>

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.150
<i>My prayers have been answered!</i>

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.760
However...

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:46.940
Th-There is one small favor I'd like to ask...

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:49.810
P-Piglette...?

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:53.860
A-Although the events of last night
did not result in physical intimacy...

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:57.150
I-I felt an undeniable connection.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:03.820
Therefore, in the name of cultivating a better
relationship with Sir Peter from here on out...

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:05.060
<i>Stop! Don't do it!</i>

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:07.830
I'd like to request your permission...

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:14.790
...to transfer to the Guild so as to remain by
Sir Peter's side and attend to his needs!

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:17.130
<i>A-Are you serious!?</i>

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:22.380
Rest assured, I shall go to great
lengths in order to gain his favor!

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:25.590
All for the sake of our great Orcland's future!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.130
Piglette...

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:35.890
What's gotten into you...!?

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:42.530
Ever since our talk, I've been doing some thinking.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:44.870
About what I really want...

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:48.410
About the desires buried deep within my heart...

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:50.540
I came to a conclusion...

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:56.770
I shall do everything in my power to prevent
Orcland from acquiring your sperm!

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:57.370
Huh?

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:06.680
Once you and I have conceived a child
who possesses your unrivaled strength...

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.140
I shall raise them,

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:10.130
train them...

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:17.100
and harness their power to crush those
Orcland pigs who made my life a living hell!

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:21.400
<i>She's got more issues than I originally thought...</i>

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:27.990
<i>Something tells me I might've created a monster,
one with a terrifying dark side...</i>

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.290
And if nothing else,

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:36.840
it means I get to stay by your side forever!

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:40.420
I promise to do my best to carry your child, Sir Peter!

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.590
I may not seem like much of an Orc...

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:46.420
But my reproductive abilities
are on par with the best of them!

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:52.950
Let's enjoy each other's company, Sir Peter!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.190
It started out as a simple crush

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:06.240
Suddenly, you were my biggest source of strength

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:08.860
Till death do us part, let's grow old together

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:12.120
This is my sincerest wish:

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:14.200
Stay with me, stay with me

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:17.870
So long time, by my side for all eternity

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:21.080
Beaten down by our daily struggles

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.500
Or soaked by a storm of rage;

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:26.460
If you get drenched, I won't hesitate

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:28.840
To be the umbrella that shields you

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:31.550
It's not so cold... I'm by your side

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:34.010
That's good enough for me

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:37.180
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:41.060
That smile of yours puts my soul at ease

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:43.480
I could search the whole world over

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.570
And find no one like you

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:48.570
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:52.530
Just the sight of you fills my heart with joy

00:11:52.530 --> 00:11:54.740
No matter how much it may hurt,

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:57.790
I pledge my life to protecting you

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:02.910
Dear Sir Peter Grill,

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:06.800
Does your roommate Tim still
like throwin' back the drinks?

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:09.550
Man, I'd love to party with you guys sometime!

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:10.050
Episode       Peter Grill and the Battle of the Fates
